   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WFK Youth Volunteer Program sends Korean university students to partner countries in collaboration with both public and private organization. The volunteers carry out team projects to contribute to the social and economic development in the partner countries and strengthen mutual understanding. They work in various fields, including primary education, healthcare, and sports, all related to SDGs and their majors, for a duration of 2-3 weeks.&#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb3c4;&#xc0c1;&#xad6d; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc0b6;&#xc758; &#xc9c8; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;, &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb3c4;&#xc0c1;&#xad6d;&#xacfc;&#xc758; &#xd611;&#xb825; &#xc99d;&#xc9c4;, &#xd65c;&#xb3d9;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc790;&#xc544;&#xc2e4;&#xd604; &#xbc0f; &#xc131;&#xc7a5;</narrative>
